E1AA                             ; ---- arithmetic and logic: ( NOS TOS -- result ) ---------------------------
E1AA                             ; "*": three 8x8 multiplies; only the low 16 bits are kept.
E1AA                             ; a = ah:al at 2,U.  b = bh:bl at ,U.
E1AA                             ; (base leaves out a cross term whose high byte is 0, which most
E1AA                             ; multiplications have: a count or a small constant.)
